MessageEvent (agent)
  assistant: I have identified and fixed the bug in the `AgentSkills` plugin where the structured system prompt blocks (including cache points) were being collapsed into a single text block due to reassigning `agent.system_prompt` with a string.

The fix changes `_on_before_invocation` to operate on the internal structured prompt content (`_system_prompt_content`) directly, removing any previously injected XML from the relevant blocks, and then appending the new XML block as a separate text block. Finally...
